    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "All capture output sample buffer timestamps are on the synchronization clock’s timebase.",
      "ko": "모든 캡처 출력 샘플 버퍼 타임스탬프는 동기화 시계의 타임베이스를 기준으로 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "23fcdfb9fa8aeb085bc1ff82c992452aa5bc348e8bc1a87f13f12dd471e827fe",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Use this clock in conjunction with the clock from an [`AVCaptureInput.Port`](avcaptureinput/port.md) object to synchronize capture output with external data sources such as Core Motion samples.",
      "ko": "이 시계는 [`AVCaptureInput.Port`](avcaptureinput/port.md) 객체의 시계와 함께 사용하여 Core Motion 샘플과 같은 외부 데이터 소스와 캡처 출력을 동기화합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "38e7d1387cc5745b40ac4986d7450cfcb65210bbd1f9e94abbf4d186b46ed015",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "The example below shows how to reverse synchronize the output timestamps to the original timestamps in the [`captureOutput(_:didOutput:from:)`](avcapturevideodataoutputsamplebufferdelegate/captureoutput(_:didoutput:from:).md) method:",
      "ko": "다음 예제는 [`captureOutput(_:didOutput:from:)`](avcapturevideodataoutputsamplebufferdelegate/captureoutput(_:didoutput:from:).md) 메서드에서 원래 타임스탬프를 출력 타임스탬프로 역방향 동기화하는 방법을 보여줍니다.",
      "sourceHash": "9a873bce7d0120525d55c628ad94be08b92934ae9067cfe6ff9b9547ee34ef87",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nfunc captureOutput(_ output: AVCaptureOutput, didOutput sampleBuffer: CMSampleBuffer, from connection: AVCaptureConnection) {\n    // Get the original and capture session clocks.\n    guard let port = connection.inputPorts.first,\n          let originalClock = port.clock,\n          let sessionClock = captureSession?.synchronizationClock else { return }\n        \n    // Get the presentation timestamp of the current sample buffer.\n    let syncedPTS = sampleBuffer.presentationTimeStamp\n        \n    // Convert the timestamp to the original timebase.\n    let originalPTS = sessionClock.convertTime(syncedPTS, to: originalClock)\n}\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nfunc captureOutput(_ output: AVCaptureOutput, didOutput sampleBuffer: CMSampleBuffer, from connection: AVCaptureConnection) {\n    // Get the original and capture session clocks.\n    guard let port = connection.inputPorts.first,\n          let originalClock = port.clock,\n          let sessionClock = captureSession?.synchronizationClock else { return }\n        \n    // Get the presentation timestamp of the current sample buffer.\n    let syncedPTS = sampleBuffer.presentationTimeStamp\n        \n    // Convert the timestamp to the original timebase.\n    let originalPTS = sessionClock.convertTime(syncedPTS, to: originalClock)\n}\n```",
      "sourceHash": "d62caf9f4cdb80381ad3cb3579a9e849df3e566bb9565a85ac1a3ac6243e6769",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
